  "description": "Single storey rear extension; alterations to foor to form end gable and enlargement of rear dormer at first floor level; single storey side extension (demolition of detached garage); installation of skylight to each front roofslope and rear dormer",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;The proposed rear dormer extension at first floor level, by reason of its scale, siting and design, would form an unduly prominent and incongruous addition that fails to respect the character and appearance of the host dwelling and the surrounding area. In particular, the development would appear visually intrusive and harmful when viewed from Heather Way, detracting from the established pattern of development and the visual amenities of the locality. The proposal is therefore contrary to the high-quality design objectives of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021–2041), and the relevant provisions of the adopted Harrow Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/div&gt;"
